sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): n/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    CSMS->>CS: GetChargingProfilesRequest (requestId = <Received requestId>)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: evseId must be omitted<br>chargingProfile.chargingProfilePurpose = <Configured chargingProfilePurpose><br>(chargingProfilePurpose is included, because the chargingProfile field is required and may not be left empty)<br>chargingProfile.stackLevel must be omitted<br>chargingProfile.chargingLimitSource must be omitted<br>chargingProfile.chargingProfileId must be omitted

    CS-->>CSMS: GetChargingProfilesResponse (status = Accepted)

    loop Steps 3 and 4 are repeated for every evse
        CS->>CSMS: ReportChargingProfilesRequest (requestId = <Received requestId>, tbc = true, evseId = i)
        CSMS-->>CS: ReportChargingProfilesResponse
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
